# =============================================================================
# Open Store — Environment Variables (reference only)
#
# Each project has its own .env file:
#   backend/.env          — FastAPI, Alembic, workers (copy backend/.env.example)
#   frontend/.env.local   — Next.js            (copy frontend/.env.example)
#
# The split keeps server secrets out of the browser bundle.
#
# Note: transactional invitation/order emails are sent by backend SMTP config,
# while verification/forgot-password emails are sent by Supabase Auth SMTP.
# =============================================================================
